<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 223 FOR NINE V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 223 FOR NINE V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 223 for nine wickets in their 50 overs against South Africa after batting first in the first of seven one day internationals at Buffalo Park on Saturday.</p>
</text>
